WEBVTT

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Are you a Mototsumitama?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.880
Choose.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.630
Die here or die here after your Tera has been drained out.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.340
You'll die no matter which option you choose.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.270
Wait!

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.530
Y-You!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:57.780
Kill her!

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.020
My brother...

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:32.480
Shishigami Reishin has been missing for half a year.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.740
The one that I should defeat is now missing,

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.990
and the human world is rotting away.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:46.000
Left aimless by fate, I wander around, unable to do a thing.

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.000
We will change.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:58.800
"New World"

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:59.510
This world shall become a world managed by those with power.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:05.970
The popularity of the PDA phone we launched is spreading among the masses.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:09.520
The Tera measuring devices that we incorporated into the phones

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:14.530
allow us to accurately map the Tera situation across the entire country.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.030
Invitation to a
luxurious dinner

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:23.780
Preparations for the Root Production Project that is scheduled to launch next week are going smoothly.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:29.460
The Subs need to be sacrificed in order to produce a Master Root.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:35.880
It's an inevitable sacrifice so that we can create a future where we, the Roots, can live in bliss with the Subs.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:42.590
Due to the rising number of Master Roots, the productivity rates of various industries increased,

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:45.060
causing the stock prices in Japan to rise.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:47.720
An economy similar to that of the Japanese asset price bubble has formed.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.230
However, we don't want this to be something temporary.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:55.320
Therefore, we have developed further and have already prepared a maintenance system.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.190
Currently, we have extended our influence into the political and economic worlds,

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:03.200
and are proposing various bills to put Master Roots in the most favorable position possible.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:10.580
I wish to change the education system to allow students who are Master Roots to receive better education.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:15.250
We shall control the fates of humans.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:20.050
By doing so, we'll definitely be able to change the world drastically, right?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:24.600
An ideal world without war or extreme poverty...

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.390
We'll turn that into reality.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.230
Kuraki-sama.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:42.610
We have received news that the Noble One will be launching a full-scale attack on us.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:44.110
Don't worry.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.990
I've already made preparations.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:48.490
Retreat?

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.000
That's right, Colonel Bernhard.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.500
You are to retreat quickly within six hours.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.710
Why?!

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:59.380
We've already finished preparations to launch an attack on the Kaionji Group!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.670
The decision is final.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.920
Please wait!

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.510
Let me talk to General Gustav!

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:09.970
There's no point in talking with you since you people from the German High Council only think about fighting.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.020
Damn it!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:21.530
General Gustav, thank you for coming all the way here.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:28.280
It's great that the Noble One is able to help our Kaionji Group in all aspects.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.660
We're different from the likes of the Shishigami Clan.

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:37.790
You aim to restructure human society on a global scale,

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:41.550
while integrating us, Mototsumitama, into that society.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:45.550
Feel free to ask us for anything if we're able to help.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:49.180
May our cooperation go well, Chairman.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.860
I never thought that a time would come when we would ally with the monkeys from the far east.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.700
I'll leave everything to you.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:11.200
Today's party is to celebrate our takeover of the world's second largest bank, Bank Royal.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.870
Don't worry, I'll carry out my assigned task

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.130
as the face of Kaionji Group.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.920
I've secured your Root.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.710
I've also confirmed that the other Sub has died.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:28.260
With this, you are now able to move about in public.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.560
Shouldn't you be a bit more happy?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.440
Everything is going according to your plan.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:41.230
"Use the Master Roots to set Japan into motion, then use Japan to set the world into motion."

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:45.150
I just want to create an ideal world.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:48.320
It's done so that all fates will proceed properly.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.870
By using the Doppeliner system?

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:03.880
But still, Father won't acknowledge me since I didn't become a Master Root.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:12.930
Even though she was given a status that isn't befitting that of a Sub...

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.980
She never understands the position she's in, does she?

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.910
Ibuki Keita

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.670
Yes?

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.800
It's me, Kuraki.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:49.090
Did you enjoy your dinner?

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.340
Yes, it was delicious.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:56.260
Feel free to tell me any requests.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.430
Thanks.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:00.940
Um...

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:01.900
Yes?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.980
Can I go home to visit my parents?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:09.440
Even though I've told them that I've transfered to work at the Kaionji Group...

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.070
It's dangerous for you to leave this room.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:18.700
I'm sorry, but this is to protect you since Ibuki-kun entrusted you to me.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.670
Is Keita-kun still missing?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.920
We're searching for him, but his location is still unknown.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.710
I know that I'm repeating myself, but if you look at the situation back then...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.630
I'm sorry.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:35.300
I wanted Ibuki-kun to help me out, too.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:39.720
I'm sorry. Kuraki-kun, you're suffering, too, right?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.350
No...

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:48.230
I'm sorry, but please bear with this a while longer until we defeat Reishin.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.240
Keita-kun...

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.090
Come, it's show time for you.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.810
Is this what I yearned for?

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.020
Reishin...

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:30.480
Living luxuriously in a world without you is...

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.830
A good number took their leave, didn't they?

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.870
They can't defy the orders from headquarters, huh?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.250
We, the Noble One, are made up of three organizations.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.750
Things aren't that straightforward.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:58.550
Maybe it'd be wiser for us to give up this useless resistance and escape overseas.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.180
Princess!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.890
How's the situation in the city?

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.650
The usual.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:12.190
The attack on the Kaionji Group was canceled.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:17.200
I was thinking of using that attack to search for Akane-san...

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.200
Princess?

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:24.540
We weren't able to reach Akane-san on her phone, were we?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.120
Those bastards from the Kaionji Group might have already killed her.

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:32.590
But the princess said that it was her own duty to save Akane-san.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.470
Sis, welcome back.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.840
Welcome back.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.650
I'm back...

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.650
Keita-san.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.080
Princess, let's hurry up and escape.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.710
How?!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.520
Sorry to cause you trouble.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.440
I'm sorry.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.520
There isn't a need for you to apologize everyday.

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:36.070
He should have more than enough Tera to reawaken by now.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.030
Why hasn't he woken up?

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.990
It's all my fault.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.120
It's all because he formed a contract with me...

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.540
You still remember the crucial points to Ryuukuu Karate, right?

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:55.050
The most important thing to all techniques is Kukuru, the power of your soul.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.470
You can't do anything if you lose the power of your soul.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.510
Most of the things have already been moved away.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.810
However, we are still left here.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:12.850
There's no way we can overlook it if the Kaionji Group disrupts the balance of Tera.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.900
How are we going to fight when we have so few people left?

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.820
Riona-san!

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.570
We have inherited Steiner's will.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.160
This should also be what his contractee desires.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.830
Putting ideals aside, what actions are you actually going to take?

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:34.710
Riona-san!

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:38.380
But this seems impossible no matter how you look at it...

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:46.100
Ladies and Gentlemen from the Noble One, you should have already received the order to retreat.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.220
People from Kaionji?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.810
They actually bypassed the security system...

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.480
I guess headquarters really is in cahoots with them.

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:55.230
We were ordered to dispose of those who went against the order.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:02.030
That female Mototsumitama there is Reishin's sister, right?

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:04.360
Confirm it with the information we have.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:07.620
Ibuki Keita should be here as well then.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.620
Grandpa...

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.260
Princess, please leave first.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.760
Take Ibuki with you!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.060
Rouki!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.020
Yakumo!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.020
Okay!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.070
Synchro!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.500
Yakumo!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.380
Oh my.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.630
Are you that dumb Master Root who ran away?

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.970
Yakumo, finish them off.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:49.640
Okay.

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.390
Sis!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:08.530
Is Ibuki Keita here?

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:18.920
Sis!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.430
Bernhard!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.190
Yakumo!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:45.190
This is the mass produced, artificial Thousands produced by Kaionji.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:48.700
Impossible...

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.110
Stop resisting pointlessly.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:54.910
We'll only drain away your Tera if you do that.

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:18.350
Princess of the Shishigami Clan, my mission is just to bring you and your companions back to Kuraki-sama.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.520
I can't...

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.650
Use exceed... alone...

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:30.320
Kuro!

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:34.410
But back then... Keita-san...

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.740
fought even though he was at his limits!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.710
This time...

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.500
I'll protect Keita-san!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.230
Kuro.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.770
Fight.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.400
Don't worry, I'm filled with Tera.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.030
Fight.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.320
No.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.910
Keita-san, I don't want to see you suffer anymore because of me!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.080
I'm thankful for you.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.920
By meeting you,

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:30.300
I became involved with this world.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.050
I've always been merely running away from fate.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.430
That's why... Fight!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.900
They're performing synchro?!

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.060
Rouki!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.780
Exceed, Unlimited Destruction!

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.210
Have things finally ended?

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.220
Kuro...

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.980
Keita-san...

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:25.730
Exceed...

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.600
Keita-san...

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.230
Keita-san!

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.240
Kuro, Exceed!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:36.740
Okay!

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:42.290
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.330
Don't be afraid, Kuro!

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.750
Finish him!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.100
Impossible, she's chaining Exceeds!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:13.150
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.240
It's the Mototsumitama!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.330
Get her!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:29.620
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.340
She has performed synchro.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.590
Keita has woken up!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.380
Princess...

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:43.260
We should do it, too!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:43.850
Okay!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.010
June!

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:45.850
Yeah!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.020
Exceed, Dreadful Storm!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.280
Go!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.990
Exceed, Land Spout!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:17.670
Exceed, Megaexe!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:37.650
I was in a coma?

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.860
Yes. For half a year.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.660
You finally woke up.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.700
Thank goodness...

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:50.160
Keita-san, if you never woke up, I...

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.500
Kuro, you...

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.960
Why are you wearing that?

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:57.840
It's quite flamboyant.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.800
G-G-Grandpa chose it for me!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.430
He said it was cute!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.300
Kuro.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.140
Thanks.

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:12.980
Keita-san...

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:21.280
If meeting him... and fighting with him is fate...

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:26.200
I have no choice but to go through everything with this bond we forged.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:27.200
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:45.380
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:45.380
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:56.810
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:56.810
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:09.200
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:09.200
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:25.590
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:25.590
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:36.190
Can't you look a bit happier, Yuki-sama?

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:41.770
"Breach"
